OL,3,GNEWSA'I thought it would make the team
OL,4,Aspecial' - a papal blessing with a
OL,5,Adifference
OL,6,
OL,7,FWearing a special jersey on the day of
OL,8,Fthe big game, sitting in the exact same
OL,9,Fseat match after match, or maybe
OL,10,Fdonning some lucky underpants.
OL,12,FThese are just some of the rituals
OL,13,Fsports fans believe can help their team
OL,14,Fwin.
OL,16,FBut 10-year-old Eoghan decided it was
OL,17,Ftime to step up his fan game.
OL,19,FFor him, the best chance to ensure
OL,20,Fsuccess would be to wear his Tyrone GAA
OL,21,Fcolours while meeting Pope Leo XIV.
